<refentry id="SQL-DROPUSER">
 <refmeta>
  <refentrytitle id="SQL-DROPUSER-TITLE">DROP USER</refentrytitle>
  <refmiscinfo>SQL - Language Statements</refmiscinfo>
 </refmeta>

 <refnamediv>
  <refname>DROP USER</refname>
  <refpurpose>remove a database role</refpurpose>
 </refnamediv>

 <indexterm zone="sql-dropuser">
  <primary>DROP USER</primary>
 </indexterm>

 <refsynopsisdiv>
<synopsis>
DROP USER [ IF EXISTS ] <replaceable class="PARAMETER">name</replaceable> [, ...]
</synopsis>
 </refsynopsisdiv>

 <refsect1>
  <title>描述</title>

  <para>
   <command>DROP USER</command>现在是<xref linkend="sql-droprole" endterm="sql-droprole-title">的一个别名。
  </para>
 </refsect1>

 <refsect1>
  <title>兼容性</title>

  <para>
   <command>DROP USER</command>语句是
   <productname>PostgreSQL</productname>的一种扩展。
   SQL 标准将用户的定义留给具体实现决定。
  </para>
 </refsect1>

 <refsect1>
  <title>另见</title>

  <simplelist type="inline">
   <member><xref linkend="sql-droprole" endterm="sql-droprole-title"></member>
  </simplelist>
 </refsect1>

</refentry>
